{
  "id": "image.generate",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Generate an image",
  "description": "Z-Image Turbo: fast, sharp text-to-image in 8 steps. Concept art, backgrounds, signs, posters, props, portraits. seamless: true makes it tile (textures). To change an existing image use image.edit; to paint in the style of reference images use image.paint.",
